  "sangamTamil": "குலந்தவம் கல்வி குடிநம்முப் பைந்தும்\nவிலங்காமல் எய்தியக் கண்ணும் - நலஞ்சான்ற\nமையறு தொல்சீர் உலகம் அறியாமை\nநெய்யிலாப் பாற்சோற்றின் நேர்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "A high tone of manners and morals. Though a man be of good caste, have performed deeds of ascetic virtue, acquired learning, is of good family and attained a ripe old age, so that in these five points he is faultless; yet his ignorance of what is thoroughly good, without stain, sanctioned by ancient precedent, and of good renown in the world's ways, will render all his advantages like thin, watery milk with boiled rice.",
